  ## Normal workflow — runs at 08:00 / 18:00 daily, and at 04:00 on non-Sundays

  **Commit-early workflow — do this exactly, every pass:**

  0. **Bidirectional tour-radar sweep (rotating, ~5 artists + 3 venues per pass).**

     Phase 3 v4 is active — the artist + venue watchlists drive a real
